# Vendor material with no reference value for this project.
# 8-Burn operation is a 204MB Windows flashing GUI (we use esptool);
# Demo_Arduino duplicates pin data already captured in README.md.
# The IDF demos stay: their BSP is the reference for the CSI camera,
# ES8311 codec and SD card, and examples/slave/CMakeLists.txt is what
# identifies the C6's factory firmware version.
docs/JC1060P470C_I_W/8-Burn operation/
docs/JC1060P470C_I_W/1-Demo/Demo_Arduino/
